v/t64.5771-25/38974447_2101040860225378_8310325426392137728_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QAuZoKf4w9gQ7kNvwGFZlek&_nc_oc=AdrqxwVxtlo6iXvOdaH3Y79K5e4T4Gz3T7Bt-Z9wjnTQu_uywe64eq2k0oGGxILOLbk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR2FnPZFawuGNAJgxnsJGEpJ0r-mih4hCq0kBj4rl6TWQ&oe=6AFB2BE1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Covert", "keywords": ["covert", "heist", "coop", "hacker", "stealth"], "long_description": "\u2022\u2022\u2022NOTE\u2022\u2022\u2022 Please make sure you have a device that is fully compatible with the companion app - Supports Android 7.0 - iOS 6 & above.\n\nRecruited by a mysterious client, you & a partner take on a series of high-profile heists. Utilize gadgets to infiltrate heavily guarded facilities as the crafty Thief in VR. Breach through security systems as the clever Hacker on a mobile device.  Cooperation & trust will be needed to sneak past guards, hack through laser grids, crack safes, & much more\u2026\n\nTeam up & pull off the heist of the century!\n\nFeatures:\n6+ hours of gameplay\nCooperative: A successful heist cannot be achieved alone!\nAsymmetric gameplay: Experience the heist as The Thief in VR, or as The Hacker on a mobile device\nCompanion app: Free! Only the VR app requires purchase\nOnline: Play with your friends & family from anywhere\nPass-and-play: Introduce your friends & family to the unique & immersive experience of VR, while putting your stealth, communication, & trust to the test!", "short_description": "Covert is a cooperative heist game where you and a friend work together to pull off the heist of a century."}]}, "developer_name": "White Elk LLC", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://whiteelkstudios.com/index.php/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://whiteelkstudios.com/index.php/terms-of-service/", "publisher_name": "Oculus Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://th