QFPUnsEY2kCw35GiG0WibHtZ9pV4P6OAHN0MMHMtswK60w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ6B1sFo-dWQvXcKKrhgzZ5TQBszzhM5k7pzNB6KmA8HQ&oe=6AFB1982"}, "display_name": "Covert", "keywords": ["covert", "heist", "coop", "hacker", "stealth"], "long_description": "Recruited by a mysterious client, you and a partner take on a series of high-profile heists. Utilize gadgets to infiltrate heavily guarded facilities as the crafty Thief in VR. Breach through security systems as the clever Hacker on a mobile device.  Cooperation and trust will be needed to sneak past guards, hack through laser grids, crack safes, and much more\u2026\n\nTeam up and pull off the heist of the century!\n\nFeatures:\n6+ hours of gameplay\nCooperative: A successful heist cannot be achieved alone!\nAsymmetric gameplay: Experience the heist as The Thief in VR, or as The Hacker on a mobile device\nCompanion app: Free! Only the VR app requires purchase\nOnline: Play with your friends and family from anywhere\nPass-and-play: Introduce your friends and family to the unique and immersive experience of VR, while putting your stealth, communication, and trust to the test!", "short_description": "Covert is a cooperative heist game where you and a friend work together to pull off the heist of a century."}]}, "developer_name": "White Elk LLC", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://whiteelkstudios.com/index.php/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://whiteelkstudios.com/index.php/privacy/", "publisher_name": "Oculus Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://thecovertgame.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "ADVENTURE", "SOCIAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor":